        "spya-zd83ts"
      ],
      "title": "Friendship was invented in 18th-century Scotland",
      "gist": "Relational living is natural and common throughout history, but it ties personal dignity to group reputation, explaining why gossip and status policing dominate such societies.",
      "sourceHeading": "Friendship was invented in 18th-century Scotland"
    },
